# Large binary assets — kept out of git history.
#
# Master copies live at ../phoolbloom-assets/ (both zips + unzipped folders).
# ONE file is deliberately kept in the publish root: phool-wallpapers.zip,
# the clean 5-PNG archive that welcome/index.html links. It must be present
# at deploy time or that download 404s. It is untracked, so a fresh clone
# will not have it — copy it back from ../phoolbloom-assets/ before deploying
# from a new checkout.
#
# OPEN ISSUE: that URL is public and guessable, so the founding-member
# wallpapers are not actually gated. Accepted for this deploy only.
phool-wallpapers*.zip
phool-wallpapers/
phool-wallpapers 2/
